      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宛如执念熊熊燃烧的战鬼一般的狂奔，\n胜利毫无疑问地被成田大进收入囊中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dea4edacc91c4fb51909fc03ec52f509932d43d9db25e4bcffffbb69010dc85e",
