      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我迅速翻阅同一卷资料中的比赛用时。\n因为是慢节奏的比赛，所以前半程当然比较慢——",
      "source_fingerprint": "63458fae142e10fd1a4c5ba07176c567dec8686881f9b40b1e877b3258cac9a9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
